pbwinput 1
# The first save of an adventure, made on the oracle (oracle.py save first_save; port/tools/oracle/README.md, "Saves"):
# from power-on with a blank save through the start menu's NEW GAME and the intro as new_game.pbwinput plays them
# (port/tests/replay), the player AAAAAAA and the rival HughAAA, into the field in front of the player's house in
# Aspertia City; through the first scripts there and in the house to the player's room, then the field menu's SAVE.
# Video frames, as new_game.pbwinput, whose presses this starts with: the oracle plays it whole, and the same file
# makes the same save on every run (SAVES in oracle.py keeps its SHA-1). The port plays its start, New Game, which
# formats the blank backup, up to the field's first script (oracle.py port-save, ctest replay_same_save).
version w2_us
frames video
# GFL's random seed as the DS builds it at start-up (oracle.py seeds first_save): the port's game takes it in
# place of its own, so that the random numbers New Game draws are the DS's, the day care's egg seed that it
# writes into the save among them (ctest replay_same_save)
seed 0x81d63ca2c9f3143e
# The title, NEW GAME, then A twice a second through the talk, the choices and the name entries, as in
# new_game.pbwinput, until the DS is past the intro
3900 START
